## Context
Audit A4 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). aedist `AGENTS.md:60`: "In autonomous mode (`/raid`), the
orchestrator never defers for human input … works around the issue." Harness
`rules/workflow.md` escalation step 5 and `/raid` Phase 2 return intent changes
(dropped or new exit criteria, expired premise) to the author.

## Decision needed
Recommended: keep the local stance for *how* questions; state that intent
changes still return to the author. Alternative: aedist opts out of the drift
guard entirely (the raid would then rewrite exit criteria unattended).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Author decision logged here
- [ ] aedist `AGENTS.md` (or `/raid`) edited to match
